# The catalog cannot be read for the first nine seconds -- longer than either
# binary takes to start and open the column under load -- and the inline
# column is open over the failure with nothing running. fx paints a frame only
# when something asks for one (`flushRequestedFrame`,
# `app_render_runtime.zig:928-929`) and nothing animates while idle, so the
# column's render path -- the only thing that asks the cache again
# (`footerContext`, `:561-563`) -- does not run: it says `unable to load
# models` after the catalog is back, and the next keystroke's frame asks again
# and lists the rows. `modelsdelay 0` stamps each read in the gateway log.
models models.json
modelsdown 9000
modelsdelay 0
wait 6
type /model
key Space
wait 0.8
snap col-down
wait 6
snap col-idle
type o
wait 1
snap col-typed
gwlog
